      "message": "I don\u0027t the resource cache expects that resources are individually abandoned. That is, it expects that resources are only abandoned when the context gets abandoned and thus all resources are abandoned.\n\nDoes this not work for your use case:\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/skia/include/core/SkImage.h;l\u003d1256?q\u003dMakeBackendTextureFromSkImage\u0026ss\u003dchromium%2Fchromium%2Fsrc:third_party%2Fskia%2F\n?",
      "parentUuid": "4e96317f_726c1407",
      "revId": "3389d164d4ccffe271f077d12520a80d31c9a904",
