        "id": 9996
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-27T18:07:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The path is:\n\nSkSurface::MakeRenderTarget\nSkSurface::makeImageSnapshot\n\nI have also tried some of the various MakeFromTexture API, but that also ends up accessing the GrBackendTexture on the wrong thread at deletion time.\n\nWhat I would like in the end is an API that would let me go from a display list to texture backed SkImage on the raster task runner\u0027s GrDirectContext, and delete that texture on the IO task runner\u0027s GrDirectContext (which is in the same sharegroup).",
      "parentUuid": "94911432_77e3e0a5",
      "revId": "3389d164d4ccffe271f077d12520a80d31c9a904",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
