      "writtenOn": "2022-07-27T18:10:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could you just use SkSurface::MakeFromBackendTexture to create the SkSurface that wraps a texture you own from the get go? We have a helper, GrDirectContext::createBackendTexture, that can assist with creating the texture.",
      "parentUuid": "97ba0085_d302cd57",
      "revId": "3389d164d4ccffe271f077d12520a80d31c9a904",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
