        "id": 9996
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-27T18:13:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That still ends up tripping single ownership asserts if the SkImage gets collected on the wrong task runner. But this violation only happens in cases where I am trying to delete the SkImage. My sense is that I need a way to let Skia know to stop trying to do anything with this texture and just let the client delete it on the right context.",
      "parentUuid": "8cd7a72a_814aebf8",
      "revId": "3389d164d4ccffe271f077d12520a80d31c9a904",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
