      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-28T13:12:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What if we just went all the way to making ~SkImage_Gpu threadsafe? The texture would get deleted with a little delay (the next time the GrDirectContext that produced the image gets used)",
      "parentUuid": "614004e7_f018c576",
      "revId": "3389d164d4ccffe271f077d12520a80d31c9a904",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
